//About Ahmad: He is a boy who lives with his Bapa and Ibu. He loves everything that serves as a base for curry puffs, like coconut and pineapple. And he hates flowers.
    "Introduction_Ahmad": "Hi, I am Ahmad, what's yours?",
    "Mon_Ahmad": "I got up early today to help Ibu to make the curry puffs.",
    "Mon2_Ahmad":"*Yawns* Hi, @... Sorry. I'm always so tired on Mondays.",
    "Mon4_Ahmad":"Peter is going to lend me a comic book, even though I prefer watching cartoons on TV.",
    "Mon6_Ahmad":"I got a low grade in geography. How am I supposed to know what Grampleton is?",
    "Mon8_Ahmad":"I asked my Bapa to get a pet, but since our village is on a border, he won't let me have it for now.#$b#You know, because of the war it's not safe.",
    "Tue_Ahmad": "My Ibu and Bapa have a food store in a high school, I sometimes goes over to help",
    "Tue2_Ahmad": "Kara visits Eloise on Sundays, how does she get back home and still be early on Monday...",
    "Tue4_Ahmad":"My ibu is going to help me with my history homework... #$b#But I'll have to borrow some books from the Pelican Town library.",
    "Tue6_Ahmad":"Hi, @. Are you married? My Bapa said that every adult needs to get married. Kakak is almost an adult, but she doesn't want to get married.",
    "Tue8_Ahmad":"Who is my best friend? From class? Hm... I think I really like Peter and Vincent. #$b#Who do I like the least? I don't know, maybe Cammi, she's really annoying.",
    "Wed_Ahmad": "I got a big sister and 2 little twin sisters",
    "Wed2_Ahmad":"My twin sisters ripped up my homework. I swear!",
    "Wed4_Ahmad":"Next week I'm going to help my Bapa at the cafeteria. #$b#The school they work at closed because of the war, but they still sell snacks to the villagers.",
    "Wed6_Ahmad":"We have to present our artistic skills for the Art seminar. I don't think I have any artistic talent, farmer.",
    "Wed8_Ahmad":"I got the highest grade in the class on the Math test. Even Peter praised me. One day I'll make a lot of money and help my family.",
    "Thu_Ahmad": "I wish we had enough help so Kakak can go to university...",
    "Thu2_Ahmad":"My Ibu and Bapa are saving money to pay for Kakak's college tuition, but it's hard...",
    "Thu4_Ahmad":"I think I want to be a businessman when I grow up. Kitty said that our life was like when we moved to Zuzu Town. #$b#Huh? Have you ever lived in Zuzu City? What was it like? Did you make a lot of money there?",
    "Thu6_Ahmad":"Kakak, my sister, is very smart. She always knows everything! EVERYTHING!",
    "Thu8_Ahmad":"What vote? I don't know anything. Who's the cutest boy in school? Am I winning?",
    "Fri_Ahmad": "One day when I grow up I will earn big bucks so my parents can retire!",
    "Fri2_Ahmad": "I forgot about today's spelling... I wonder if Beng has studied...",
    "Fri4_Ahmad": "Cammi said we will have a test today! TODAY!",
    "Fri6_Ahmad":"Thank goodness it's Friday. I'm going to sleep in tomorrow and then spend the day playing soccer!",
    "Fri8_Ahmad":"Tomorrow I'm going to the beach to fly a kite with my bapa. I'm excited!",
    "Sat_Ahmad": "...",
    "Sun_Ahmad": "...",
    "Spring_Mon2_Ahmad": "I really like spring, the seasonal fruits are tastier. #b#Do you already know what you're going to plant this season?",
    "Spring_10_Ahmad_2": "Since today is Vincent's birthday, I'm going to share my curry puffs with him.",
    "Spring_15_Ahmad": "I wanted to go to the Desert Festival, but my mom said I can't ride the bus alone.",
    "Spring_15_Ahmad_2": "Another year I won't go to the desert festival!",
    "Summer_4_Ahmad_2": "I'm not getting Jas any presents. The boys will think I like her!",
    "Summer_8_Ahmad": "Summer is my Ibu's favorite season.",
    "Summer_15_Ahmad_2": "Yesterday was Miss Flor's birthday. I brought her curry puffs.",
    "Summer_26_Ahmad": "Oh boy, summer is coming to an end.",
    "Fall_2_Ahmad_2": "Today is Miss Penny's birthday. I brought her curry puffs!",
    "Fall_9_Ahmad": "When I was coming to school, a flurry of orange leaves flew over me. It was magical!",
    "Fall_26_Ahmad": "I'm not a big fan of Spirits' Eve. We don't celebrate it at home. But I do like pumpkin pie.",
    "Fall_26_Ahmad_2": "My Ibu will make a great pumpkin pie tomorrow. Huh? I thought I told you that my family doesn't celebrate Spirits' Eve",
    "Winter_15_Ahmad": "Miss Flor said the boats that came to the beach sell strange things.",
    "Winter_15_Ahmad_2": "I was wondering what kind of food they sell on the boats at the Night Market.",
    "Winter_24_Ahmad": "Ibu and Bapa have already done their shopping for the Festival of the Winter Star, I can't wait to see what they got for me.",
//Gifts
    "gifts.Ahmad.love": "I got a gift from the farmer! How cool!",
    "gifts.Ahmad.love_(O)88":"Wow! I love coconut, how did you know? Thanks!",
    "gifts.Ahmad.love_(O)832":"That's so cool! I LOVE this!",
    "gifts.Ahmad.like": "Just like my ibu and my bapa, I like it very much!",
    "gifts.Ahmad.like_(O)907":"It's not exactly a curry puffs, but it's tasty all the same. Thanks.",
    "gifts.Ahmad.dislike": "Is this for me? Sorry, but I don't want it",
    "gifts.Ahmad.dislike_(O)418":"I don't like flowers, sorry.",
    "gifts.Ahmad.hate": "Jeez! I don't want this!",
    "gifts.Ahmad.hate_(O)402":"My ibu always taught me to be polite, but I hate flowers!",
    "gifts.Ahmad.neutral": "Nice... I guess",
    "gifts.Ahmad.BDPos": "WOW! This gift is fantastic! Thanks for remembering my birthday.",
    "gifts.Ahmad.BDNeg": "Is this a joke? I can't believe you got me this for my birthday. I don't like it...",
    "gifts.Ahmad.stardroptea": "This drink smells like home. I like it!",
//Amy
    "Introduction_Amy": "Hi, I'm Amy, I live in a village a little far away, and my old school's classes were canceled because of the war.$0",
    "Mon_Amy": "I don't understand math at all, Rupert was the one who helped me.$2#b#Huh? Oh, he's my brother and he went to fight in the war.$0",
    "Mon2_Amy":"Hi, farmer @. I'm fine, although I seem a little sad. I just miss my brother. $2",
    "Mon4_Amy":"My mom always said that we should pray to Yoba to protect those in the war zone, like my brother.$0#$b#Do you pray for soldiers, @?$2",
    "Mon6_Amy":"I had to read some books for a make-up test. At least the stories are interesting. $0#$b#Have you read 'Percival the Rabbit'? $1",
    "Mon8_Amy":"Keahi hid behind the bush to scare me yesterday, but I scared him first. I'm not stupid! Hehehe...$1",
    "Tue_Amy": "I like playing basketball the most, but the girls don't like it very much...$3",
    "Tue2_Amy": "Would basketball be a good science project?$0",
    "Tue4_Amy":"Yesterday Miss Penny passed a school project on the history of the Ferngill Republic... How boring!$3",
    "Tue6_Amy":"I got a good grade on my make-up exam, farmer. Peter helped me too. He's a good friend. $1",
    "Tue8_Amy":"I think I'm closest to Peter, Jas, and Vincent... $0#$b#Who do I like the least? I think Keahi and... Maybe... Uh... Cammi. $0",
    "Wed_Amy": "I didn't do my homework, I had to help Mom with the harvest. $0#b#Yes, we sell vegetables to the grocery store near our house.$1",
    "Wed2_Amy": "The girls said they're going to play basketball with me. I'm so happy! $1",
    "Wed4_Amy":"How many mayors has Pelican Town had? Don't you know? I'll ask the teacher.$0",
    "Wed6_Amy":"Does basketball count as an artistic talent? We have to present something in the art seminar.$0",
    "Wed8_Amy":"I can't wait for my brother to come back so I can play basketball with him.$1",
    "Thu_Amy": "I'm looking forward to recess!$1",
    "Thu2_Amy":"Kitty said that in Zuzu City there is a university, and they 'help' athletes... Like, basketball players.$1",
    "Thu4_Amy":"A field trip to Zuzu City would be pretty cool, don't you think?$1",
    "Thu6_Amy":"Who's your favorite basketball player?$1",
    "Thu8_Amy":"In this poll for the cutest boy in class, I voted for Yuuma, but I wanted to vote for Peter. I was embarrassed.$0",
    "Fri_Amy": "Oh no, today we have spelling. Sometimes Miss Penny takes an oral exam, I always get it wrong. $3",
    "Fri2_Amy": "I need to study more spelling.$2",
    "Fri4_Amy": "I can't study anymore... Cammi said we have a test today!$2",
    "Fri6_Amy":"Hey, @! Did you watch the latest episode of 'Bob Psy 90'? It was awesome!$1",
    "Fri8_Amy":"I'm tired of studying... I just want to play basketball!$2",
    "Sat_Amy": "...",
    "Sun_Amy": "...",
    "spring_2_Amy_2": "The year started off so well, I got a letter from Rupert. $1#b#He sent me a drawing he made of a field of flowers. The paper was a little stained and wrinkled, but I really liked it. $1#b#I hope he comes back soon!$2",
    "spring_Wed4_Amy":"Spring is my favorite season, because of apricots. I love apricots!$1",
    "spring_10_Amy_2": "What? It's Vincent's birthday today? Oh, geez...$0",
    "spring_15_Amy": "I heard there's always a festival out there in the desert around this time of year.$1",
    "spring_15_Amy_2": "When Rupert comes back from the war, he'll take me to the desert festival. I'm sure.$1",
    "spring_16_Amy_2": "Trinnie is very happy because today is her birthday!$1",
    "spring_23_Amy": "Jas and Trinnie told me that here in Pelican Town there is a festival where people only dance. Is it true, @?$0",
    "spring_23_Amy_2": "I think it's a bit boring when people only go to dance. There should at least be a dance competition!$0",
    "summer_4_Amy_2": "It's Jas's birthday today! I brought her a pink cake because it's her favorite food!$1",
    "summer_8_Amy": "I LOVE SUMMER! The weather is perfect for playing!$1",
    "summer_15_Amy": "I heard it was Miss Flor's birthday yesterday. I'm going to make a nice drawing for her.$1",
    "summer_26_Amy": "Summer goes by, and I didn't even have enough fun.$2",
    "summer_26_Amy_2": "I heard Eloise talking to Kara about moon jellyfish. Why are they so important?$0",
    "fall_2_Amy": "Today is Miss Penny's birthday, I brought her a melon.$1",
    "fall_12_Amy": "I didn't do my homework because we got a letter from my brother.$2#b#It was good news, so my mom made a bunch of sweets to celebrate.$1",
    "fall_26_Amy_1": "Tomorrow is Spirits' Eve, do you know what your costume will be?$0#b#At the party in my village, I'm going to dress up as a basketball player.$2",
    "fall_26_Amy_2": "This year my costume for Spirits' Eve will be a zombie trainer!$1",
    "winter_12_Amy": "When Rupert, my brother, comes back from the war, we're going to make lots of snowmen.$1",
    "winter_15_Amy": "Did you see the strange boats that washed up on the beach?$0",
    "winter_15_Amy_2": "Before I got to school, I went to the beach. The boats have already arrived for the night market!$0",
    "winter_24_Amy": "The only thing I wanted as a present was for Rupert to come back from the war.$2",
    "winter_24_Amy_2": "I'm happy because yesterday I was able to talk to my brother on the phone. He said he missed me a lot. $1#b#That was a great gift. $1",
