    "gifts.Amy.love": "WOW! This is my favorite!$1",
    "gifts.Amy.love_(O)634":"Whenever I eat apricots, I feel stronger. I love this fruit!$1",
    "gifts.Amy.love_(O)194":"How do you know I love eating fried eggs? Thank you!$1",
    "gifts.Amy.like": "This is really cool. Thanks...$1",
