//Cammi
    "Introduction_Cammi": "Heya! The name's Cammi, whaths your name?#$e#I mean What's your name.. #$e#I just lostht my front teeth, hehe.",
    "Resort_Entering_Cammi": "Woaaah wowowowo! I wanna do Everthing!",
    "Resort_Leaving_Cammi": "Ahhh, I'm sthpent!",
    "Resort_Shore_Cammi": "She thells sthea shells by the sthea shore...#$e#Ughh, I can't do it!1",
    "Resort_Cammi": "The sun feels SO Gooood.#$e#I wanna live in a place that'sth always warm.",
    "Mon_Cammi": "Oh wouldja look at that.#$e#It stheems you're a fan of me.",
    "Mon4_Cammi": "Plants are so cool, some plants can make you go all itchy.",
    "Tue_Cammi": "Heya Farmer!#$e#Look at those arms, I wanna swing on them. Hehe.",
    "Tue2_Cammi": "So much sthtudying to do... It all feelth so pointless.0#$e#I never us this stuff when I'm outside.",
    "Tue4_Cammi":"Little farmer, help a poor girl... What do you know aboutch Ferngill Plush?#$b# What? Republic? I'm pretty sure it's 'Plush'.",
    "Tue8_Cammi": "Hi, @!#$e#Pick me up! I wanna go Up, Up![773]",
    "Wed4_Cammi": "Hi there, @!#$e#Ah. What am I doing?#$e#Just... kid things.",
    "Wed6_Cammi":"I have many artistchic gifts, @. I know I'll get the highest grade in the Art...Se-Semi...Seminar!",
    "Thu_Cammi": "Ah, my tong keeps mesthing up my words.1#$b#Good thing I'm cute, otherwise It'd be a problem.",
    "Thu2_Cammi": "Wanna see me do a handsthtand?#$e#Watch, Watch! Sthee, I'm doing it!",
    "Thu6_Cammi": "Heya, let me play on your farm?#$e#Come Oooon.0#$e#You know I'm a little ray of sunshine!",
    "Thu8_Cammi":"That's right, @! Kitty and I are going to choose the most handsome boy in the class. #$b# Why didn't I do the same vote for the girls? I think the answer is pretty obvious.#$b#I would win.",
    "Fri_Cammi": "Don't be alarmed, I simply enjoy screaming.#$e#Heeheehee!?#$e#What? Like you don't do weird sthuff?^Ah well, you'll learn to love it.",
    "Fri2_Cammi": "Sthience is dumb.0#$b#It turns fun sthuff like experimenths into boring paper work.#$e#Gym is waaaay better.#0",
    "Fri4_Cammi": "I lied about today's test. Hehehehe. Don't tell anyone!",
    "Sat_Cammi": "School's out!#$b#Are you not working today too?.#$e#We gotta make today a good one then.^K, catch ya later!",
    "Sat4_Cammi": "D-don't stare at my tooth gap!",
    "Sat10_Cammi": "You Wanna play with me?#$e#When I feel like having some fun my mind goes right to you.",
    "Sun_Cammi": "I can't sthop to talk right now.#$e#I need to do as much as possible before I go back to school tomorrow.",
    "Sun4_Cammi": "I wanna pinch your cheeks. Can I pinch your cheeks?.#$e#I'm gonna pinch your cheeks!",
    "Sun8_Cammi": "Heya! Can you give me a ride?#$b#I like being ontop of things!#$e#Makes me feel so... Big!",
    "spring_10_Cammi_2": "Yes, I know it's Vincent's birthday. No, I didn't bring any presents. #$b#But I found some gum at the bottom of my bag. I think he'll like it.",
    "spring_16_Cammi_2": "Today is Trinnie's birthday. She is sooo cool, but I forgot her present. What now?",
    "summer_10_Cammi": "Wow there's a lot of strange sthuff going in that pot.1#$e#Hey, I dare you to but something gross in it!",
    "summer_15_Cammi_2": "I heard it was Miss Flor's birthday. I don't have anything to give her as a present.",
    "summer_27_Cammi": "I'm all sthweaty and sthticky.#$e#I love to run but if I sthtop for a minute I go all.. Blegh!1",
    "summer_Mon_Cammi": "Summers out and I'm sthtuck inside here.#$b#Laaaaaaaame!0",
    "summer_Mon6_Cammi": "I want to go sun bathing.#$e#I bet I'd look Super cute with a tan.",
    "summer_Tue_Cammi": "Whew... Friday can't come soon enough.0",
    "summer_Tue6_Cammi": "Haaahh, I'm hungry.#$b#Hey farmer, you got anything for me to sthnack on?",
    "summer_Wed_Cammi": "I'm so figity today.#$b#Is this clock moving slower?#$e#It is, I know it is!",
    "summer_Wed6_Cammi": "Thanks for dropping by, you make a boring school day a little more exciting!#$e#You wanna play with me later?",
    "summer_Wed8_Cammi": "I'm gonna put a thumbtack on Penny's chair.#$e#It's OK, she won't get mad.#$e#I'm too cute to get in trouble.",
    "summer_Thu_Cammi": "Uggh, my butt is so sore from sthitting all day.1#$e#Huh? Unladylike?#$e#Why can't ladies talk about their butts?...#$b#Huh? Oooooh!#$b#I meant sitting, SITTING!!!#$b#",
    "summer_Thu8_Cammi": "...She got mad.",
    "summer_Fri_Cammi": "I'm pretty bad at school but so long as I'm better than Vincthent I'm OK.",
    "summer_Fri8_Cammi": "Jas is so pretty, and she doesn't even try.#$e#...Oh I'm not jealous, I'm just as cute as her.#$b#Right?",
    "summer_Sat_Cammi": "Wanna tasthe something really good?#$e#Me too! Can you go get us some ice cream. Pweeeease!",
    "summer_Sat8_Cammi": "There's plenty of time left before the day is over.#$e#I love long summer days.",
    "summer_Sun_Cammi": "The last thing I gotta do today is think of a good excuse for why I didn't do my homework.",
    "summer_Sun6_Cammi": "You're so cool @! Getting to work all day outside in the summer.#$e#I think I'm your fan now, heehee!",
    "Fall_15_Cammi": "Hah, cha cha cha!#$e#I feel like dancing.",
    "Fall_26_Cammi": "Oh boy do I got a fun game for you!#$e#%Let's go in the forest where no one can hear you scream.",
    "Fall_28_Cammi": "Winter's coming!#$e#Thanks world, I hate it!0",
    "Fall_Mon_Cammi": "Hi.#$e#Uh, school's a bit tough right now...#$b#We'll talk later.0",
    "Fall_Mon6_Cammi": "Gimmie Head Pats!!!#$e#I'm doing well at school today, now I get to be spoiled!",
    "Fall_Tue_Cammi": "Somebody asked if I'd like a lolipop.#$e#I was like, How old do you think I am?!#$e#%...So then I said yes!",
    "Fall_Tue6_Cammi": "I'm getting better at saying my 'esthes'!#$b#I mean my 's' sounds, gah!1",
    "Fall_Tue10_Cammi": "I'm feeling sick and you sthill want to play with me?#$b#Wow, you're pretty brave.",
    "Fall_Wed_Cammi": "This is nice.#$b#A lot of activities are waiting for me when I get back home.",
    "Fall_Wed6_Cammi": "Hmmm, So much stuff is happening outside.#$e#Yet every day I have to stay in school while the world goes on.0#$b#I wish school was an option.1",
    "Fall_Thu_Cammi": "Do you know what I like best?#$b#I like to keep that a secret but maybe you'll figure it out one day.",
    "Fall_Thu8_Cammi": "Oh? You think I act like a spoiled baby sometimes.#$e#Well then be an adult and take care of me.",
    "Fall_Fri_Cammi": "Penny is giving us lots of homework this weekend.#$e#No way am I doing it though.",
    "Fall_Sat_Cammi": "I love this hat.#$e#Mommy gave it to me on a trip we took together.",
    "Fall_Sat6_Cammi": "I wanna lay on some leaves for the rest of the day#$b#Lay down with me @.",
    "Fall_Sun_Cammi": "Magic is cool but I think building things on your own is more impresthive.",
    "Fall_Sun8_Cammi": "Do you like love stories?#$e#I think they're... they're interesting.",
    "Winter_1_Cammi": "Mom wanted me to dress proper this winter but I don't really like to wear pants.",
    "Winter_7_Cammi": "Too cold, Toooooo Cold!#$e#Let's get this over with!0",
    "Winter_11_Cammi":"I don't like Keahi very much. His pranks are the worst! That's why I won't give him a gift!",
    "Winter_15_Cammi": "Do you know what they sell in those weird boats over there on the beach?",
    "Winter_24_Cammi": "One thing great about this time is prethents!.",
    "Winter_28_Cammi": "I'm NOT gonna miss the snow!",
    "Winter_Mon_Cammi": "What's farming like?#$e#You don't need schooling to do it right?",
    "Winter_Mon10_Cammi": "Ah, your face is so Cute!#$e#%It's all puffy and rosy red.",
    "Winter_Tue_Cammi": "C-c-cold.#$e#I hate to sthay it but I'm glad to be in school today.",
    "Winter_Tue8_Cammi": "I had a pet slime once.#$e#Snuck it into school one day and let it loose, that was a great day.",
    "Winter_Wed_Cammi": "If I had a better seat I could get away with a lot more sthuff when Penny isn't looking.",
    "Winter_Wed8_Cammi": "Here, have my special juice! Mom says it's Really good for you.[773]",
    "Winter_Thu_Cammi": "Won't be long now. Weekends almost here!",
    "Winter_Thu10_Cammi": "I really wish someone would hold me until I went to sleep like Mom used to do!#$e#I'm not too old for that.. am I?",
    "Winter_Sat8_Cammi": "Can you help me with something?#$e#I wanna work on my sthpeaking better!", 
    "Winter_Sun8_Cammi": "I don't like the cold but snow rides are fun.",
//Gifts
    "gifts.Cammi.love": "I love this. Thank you so much, farmer.",
    "gifts.Cammi.like": "This is so cool. I like it..",
    "gifts.Cammi.dislike": "I don't want this...",
    "gifts.Cammi.hate": "You hate me? Why did you give me this then?",
    "gifts.Cammi.neutral": "This is actually kind of cool...",
    "gifts.Cammi.BDPos": "Is this for me? Is this my birthday present? Yay! I love it, you're awesome, ${farmer^farmer}$!",
    "gifts.Cammi.BDNeg": "What? Is this my birthday present? IT'S AWFUL! I DON'T WANT THIS!",
    "gifts.Cammi.stardroptea": "A warm and cozy drink, I love this tea!",
//Donny
    "Introduction_Donny": "Hello, I'm Donny. I live in the same village as Kara, and my family owns a pizza place.$1",
    "Mon_Donny": "I hate Mondays...$3",
    "Mon2_Donny": "Kitty said the best pizza in the world is from Zuzu City. Of course not. $3#b#The best pizza ever is from the Carbone family! $1",
    "Mon4_Donny":"Hi, farmer @. I brought some toys hidden in my bag, but don't tell the teacher. $0",
    "Mon6_Donny":"Have you ever eaten Mr. Gus's food? Jas and Vincent said he's the best cook in the village. Is it true?$0",
    "Mon8_Donny":"There's a green lake in my village. They say a monster lives there, but I've never seen anything.$0",
    "Tue_Donny": "I managed to do my science homework, but I didn't understand any of the math.$2",
    "Tue2_Donny": "Would making pizzas be a good science project?$0",
    "Tue4_Donny":"I haven't started my history project yet, but my dad is going to help me.$1",
    "Tue6_Donny":"Hey, farmer, do you make goat cheese on your farm? I think a pizza made with goat cheese would be nice.$1",
    "Tue8_Donny":"Hi, farmer @! Who are my friends at school? I think everyone. I don't have any problems with anyone.$0",
    "Wed_Donny": "I really like talking to Keahi, his dad is the second best cook I've ever met. $1#b#Who's the first? My dad!$1",
    "Wed2_Donny": "Miss Penny complimented my homework. I'm so happy.$1",
    "Wed4_Donny":"I'm upset, I left my pencil case on the bus, and now I've lost it forever. My dad is mad at me.$3",
    "Wed6_Donny":"For the Arts Seminar, I'm going to present the Art of Cooking... The Art of making great pizzas!$1",
    "Wed8_Donny":"My mom is pretty mad, she ordered some stuff from Grampleton and it hasn't arrived yet. My dad said the train was looted...$2",
    "Thu_Donny": "My family makes their own cheeses for our pizzas. They're the best pizzas in town.$1",
    "Thu2_Donny":"Kitty told me there's a cooking class at Zuzu City University. What do they teach? Canned food?$0",
    "Thu4_Donny":"My dad changed the wallpaper in my room. I hated it, why don't parents listen to their kids? Do you have kids?$3",
    "Thu6_Donny":"I don't really like studying, but I like coming to school because of my friends.$0",
    "Thu8_Donny":"That's right, girls want to vote for the cutest boy. I wonder what it would be like if it were the other way around... $3#$b#I think I'd vote for Cammi.$0",
    "Fri_Donny": "I don't know, because everyone complains about spelling. It's so easy...$0",
    "Fri2_Donny": "I'm leaving early today, I need to help my family at the pizzeria!$0",
    "Fri4_Donny":"I need to get a good grade on today's test! Yes, Cammi said we have a test today!$2",
    "Fri6_Donny":"Yesterday's episode of 'Bob Psy 90' was awesome. Did you watch that cartoon, farmer?$1",
    "Fri8_Donny":"Today my parents are going out on a date. I find it so boring...$3",
    "Sat_Donny": "...",
    "Sun_Donny": "...",
    "spring_10_Donny_2": "It's Vincent's birthday today, I brought some of the pizza my dad made last night.$1",
    "spring_22_Donny_2": "Eloise's birthday today, I think she's the only girl in the class I like. $1#b#What? No, I mean, like as a friend! Like a friend!$3",
    "summer_10_Donny": "Vincent and Keahi told me that here in the Village, you have a festival where everyone throws something into a huge cauldron. $0#b#Is that safe? $3",
    "summer_10_Donny_2": "If I could throw anything into tomorrow's festival pot, I'd throw in the cheese my dad makes. #b#It's so tasty! $1",
    "summer_15_Donny_2": "Miss Flor's birthday was yesterday. I wonder if she likes pizza?$0",
    "summer_16_Donny": "I can't stand this hot weather anymore!$3",
    "fall_2_Donny_2": "Today is Miss Penny's birthday. Do you think she would like pizza?$0",
    "fall_15_Donny": "I always bring some pizza in my lunch box to share with others.$1",
    "fall_26_Donny": "We're having a Spirits' Eve night at the pizzeria. If you come in costume, you'll get a discount!$1",
    "fall_26_Donny_2": "This year, I'm going to help my parents on the night of Spirits' Eve, dressed as a ghost chef.$1",
    "winter_11_Donny": "You can forget everyone's birthday except Keahi's. Or he might put something stinky on your clothes!$2",
    "winter_15_Donny": "Jas and Vicent said they sell coffee at the Night Market. No, I hate coffee, but my dad really likes it.$0",
    "winter_15_Donny_2": "You know what's missing at the night market? Pizza!$1",
    "winter_24_Donny": "My parents have been getting ready for the Winter Star party since yesterday. It'll be at home, but my grandparents will come visit us.$1",
    "winter_24_Donny_2": "My grandparents are coming to the Winter Star party again. Let's celebrate at home.$1",
//Gifts
    "gifts.Donny.love": "You nailed it, farmer! That's a wonderful gift...$1",
    "gifts.Donny.love_(0)426":"Wow! WOW! Is it from your farm? Of course I loved it! Thank you! $1",
    "gifts.Donny.love_(0)424":"Wow! WOW! Is it from your farm? Of course I loved it! Thank you! $1",
    "gifts.Donny.like": "That's cool! I like that. Thanks!$1",
    "gifts.Donny.like_(0)422":"Wow, that's cool! I'm going to try making a pizza with this, I wonder if it'll be tasty? $1",
    "gifts.Donny.dislike": "Ugh... I don't like that!$3",
    "gifts.Donny.dislike_(0)419":"Geez, I don't want that. It smells terrible.$3",
    "gifts.Donny.hate": "That's the worst gift ever! I hate it!$3",
    "gifts.Donny.hate_(0)241":"Oh no! I hate burgers! Get that out of here! $3",
    "gifts.Donny.neutral": "Thanks, I think...$0",
    "gifts.Donny.neutral_(0)262":"Thanks. I'll put it in the mill at home, but it'll take a while to turn into good pizza dough. $0",
    "gifts.Donny.BDPos": "Wow! I'm so glad you remembered my birthday, farmer. Thank you so much!$1",
    "gifts.Donny.BDNeg": "Thanks, but I don't like this. I don't want this for my birthday...$3",
    "gifts.Donny.stardroptea": "This is a great drink to have with pizza. It's really tasty!$1",
//Kara
    "Introduction_Kara": "Hello! My name is Kara, I am a student at the Pelican School.#b#I live in a small neighboring village.#b#We don't have a school there, so I come here every day.#b#Nice to meet you!",
    "Mon_Kara": "Its the start of the week! I get to see everyone again!",
    "Mon1_Kara": "I done all my weekend homework, I hope Ms Penny will be happy with my work.",
    "Mon4_Kara":"Tonight, my parents are taking me to Donny's family's pizza place. They make delicious pizza!",
    "Mon6_Kara":"I'm reading about the life of rabbits. Do you raise rabbits on your farm?",
    "Tue_Kara": "Beng and Ahmad were very naughty yesterday... They tried to scare Russel!",
    "Tue2_Kara":"I thought I'd introduce endangered species for the science project!",
    "Tue4_Kara":"Eloise and I are going to talk to Mr. Gunther after class. He should know all about the history of the Ferngill Republic.",
    "Tue6_Kara":"I've started taking notes on the animals I encounter. #$b#One day I'm going to write a book like that long-haired guy who's always writing. #$b#Is his name Elliott? Yeah, just like Mr. Elliott.",
    "Wed_Kara": "Microoscop...M..I.C..R... ohhhh spelling is on friday...",
    "Wed2_Kara": "I wonder what did mommy packed for my lunch today... Hope its something sweet.",
    "Wed4_Kara":"I was wondering what Eloise is going to do later...",
    "Thu_Kara": "The week is almost ending.",
    "Thu2_Kara": "Ms Flor told me that she could see my village when riding up the cable car.",
    "Thu4_Kara":"I like watching animals, @, but you can't see much from school.",
    "Thu6_Kara":"Eloise said there are lots of interesting fish in East Scarp. I'd really like to see them.",
    "Thu8_Kara":"I didn't want to take part in the vote to decide which boy is the cutest. I don't think any of them are cute.",
    "Fri_Kara": "I am going to score full marks for spelling today!",
    "Fri2_Kara": "Vincent spent all his time to catch snails yesterday... he even brought one to class.. yeeks!",
    "Fri4_Kara":"Cammi said we'll have a test, so I'm going to study a little more.",
    "Fri6_Kara":"Yesterday when we were walking back to the bus, we heard an adult say a really bad word. #$b#The teacher said I can't repeat it, so don't ask.",
    "Fri8_Kara":"Now I draw all the animals and make up stories about them. Like the book 'Percival the Rabbit'. #$b#It's really fun. There's Mr. Rabbit, Mrs. Fox...",
    "Sat_Kara": "There are so many books to read at the library.",
    "Sat2_Kara": "Did you know that there are 20 different species of hamsters? The largest is can grow to 18cm!",
    "Sat4_Kara":"Hey, @! Did you know my mom is also a teacher? I mean, she gives private violin lessons in Zuzu City.",
    "Sat6_Kara":"Yep! I'm going to go animal watching in Pelican Town today!",
    "Sun_Kara": "One day I will grow up and become a vet.",
    "Sun2_Kara": "I wonder what do my classmates do in the weekends...",
    "Sun4_Kara":"I think I'll read some books at the museum today. There are a lot of animals I haven't met yet.",
    "Sun6_Kara":"Hey, @! When are you going to let me see the animals on your farm? I promise I'll only watch them from afar.",
    "spring_2_Kara": "I love spring. It's my favorite season.",
    "spring_12_Kara": "There's an egg festival tomorrow, but I won't be attending because I'll be celebrating in the village where I live.",
    "spring_12_Kara_2": "Trinnie and Keahi told me there will be cute animals at the festival tomorrow. Too bad I won't be able to participate.",
    "spring_15_Kara": "At the desert festival, you get strange eggs. What animal's eggs are they?",
    "spring_15_Kara_2": "Aren't you going to the desert festival?",
    "spring_22_Kara_2": "Today is my best friend Eloise's birthday! She loves daffodils!",
    "summer_4_Kara": "Don't forget that today is Jas' birthday. She gets sad when people forget her birthday.",
    "summer_15_Kara": "Yesterday was Miss Flor's birthday. She loves the violet Devil's Claw!",
    "summer_16_Kara": "What kind of animals appear in summer?",
    "summer_27_Kara": "Eloise is going to tell me about the moon jellyfish dance. Where I live we can't see jellyfish.",
    "summer_27_Kara_2": "Jas is going to have Miss Haley photograph the moon jellyfish passage for me. I'm so excited!",
    "fall_2_Kara": "Today is Miss Penny's birthday! She loves that weird Desert fish!",
    "fall_15_Kara": "I heard that tomorrow there will be a fair here in the village and there will be lots of animals. But my mother wouldn't let me participate.",
    "fall_15_Kara_2": "The festivals in Pelican Town are the best. Too bad I can't participate in any of them.",
    "fall_26_Kara": "Eloise told me that there's a Spirits' Eve party in East Scarp. I wanted to go, but my mom wouldn't let me.",
    "fall_26_Kara_2": "I heard that on the day of Spirits' Eve, magic fills the air in Pelican Town!",
    "winter_8_Kara":"Eloise and her dad brought me. I'm happy to finally be attending a Pelican Town festival!",
    "winter_15_Kara": "Miss Penny said that the boats are down at the beach for the Night Market. There's a submarine there!",
    "winter_15_Kara_2": "Do you know what types of fish we can see from inside the Night Market submarine?",
//Gifts
    "gifts.Kara.love": "Wow! Is this for me? How wonderful! I love it.",
    "gifts.Kara.like": "That's so cute, I really like it...",
    "gifts.Kara.dislike": "I don't like this...",
    "gifts.Kara.hate": "Ugh! Is this for me? I hate it...",
    "gifts.Kara.neutral": "That's so cool. Thank you.",
    "gifts.Kara.BDPos": "Who told you it's my birthday today? Eloise? Jas? It doesn't matter. I loved your present!",
    "gifts.Kara.BDNeg": "This is my birthday present? Oh, oh, oh, but I don't like it! I hate it!",
    "gifts.Kara.stardroptea": "I heard this tea has magical properties from a star. It's so delicious!",
//Kimberly
    "Introduction_Kimberly": "Hey, I'm Kimberly. Are you a farmer? $0",
    "Mon_Kimberly": "I'm studying now to become an archaeologist in the future, like my aunt.$1",
    "Mon2_Kimberly": "Have you been to the mines? What's it like there? What did you see? $0",
    "Mon4_Kimberly": "I once met Mr. Gunther near the school, he said that if I try hard, when I grow up, I can contribute to the museum!$1",
    "Mon6_Kimberly":"I'd like to visit Port Drake someday. They say it's an interesting place, but very far from here.$0",
    "Mon8_Kimberly":"The teacher lent me some books about archaeology. She borrowed them from the museum.$0",
    "Tue_Kimberly": "Eloise told me that there's an archaeologist in East Scarp. I'd like to meet him sometime...$1",
    "Tue2_Kimberly": "Would archaeology be a good topic for a science project?$0",
    "Tue4_Kimberly":"I'm really excited about the history project. I love learning about the past!$1",
    "Tue6_Kimberly":"Why do I need to be good at math if I'm going to be an archaeologist?$3",
    "Tue8_Kimberly":"My artifact collection has reached 100 pieces. Mr. Gunther said it's a great collection.$1",
    "Wed_Kimberly": "Kara told me that there are a lot of books about archaeology and interesting artifacts at the museum.$0",
    "Wed2_Kimberly": "I wanted to go into the mines, but a one-eyed old man wouldn't let me get close! $3#$b#I'm not that young!$3",
    "Wed4_Kimberly":"Hi @, my aunt just came back from Chestervale, and she brought some pebbles. I decided to give this one to you. I hope you like it![6]$1",
    "Wed6_Kimberly":"Can I show my collection of artifacts and antiques at the Arts Seminar? What do you think? $0",
    "Wed8_Kimberly":"My mom said that maybe because of the war, my aunt will have to stop traveling. How annoying...$2",
    "Thu_Kimberly": "Do you find a lot of artifacts on your walks?$0",
    "Thu2_Kimberly": "In the village I live in, there are no museums or anything like that.$2#$b#So my aunt travels all over the world collecting artifacts and antiques.$1",
    "Thu4_Kimberly":"How old do you think Pelican Town is? The town I live in turned 110 years yesterday. It's considered a young town, you know?$0",
    "Thu6_Kimberly":"Yesterday my town was without power all night. They said it was because of the war, I didn't understand anything.$0",
    "Thu8_Kimberly":"Cammi and Kitty wanted to know which boy was the cutest in school. I voted for Vincent, he's cool.$1",
    "Fri_Kimberly": "Today we have spelling, but I was wondering when we can study archaeology$0",
    "Fri2_Kimberly": "I wanted to study archaeology instead of knowing which word is right or wrong.$3",
    "Fri4_Kimberly": "Trinnie said Cammi lied about today's test. But I'm still a little worried.$2",
    "Fri6_Kimberly":"I tried to like 'Bob Psy 90' since everyone seems to watch it, but I couldn't. I prefer period dramas.$0",
    "Fri8_Kimberly":"I hope war doesn't destroy artifacts. Mom said war destroys everything.$2",
    "Sat_Kimberly": "...",
    "Sun_Kimberly": "...",
    "Spring_12_Kimberly": "If I entered the Egg Festival, I would win without a problem.$1",
    "Spring_12_Kimberly_2": "I thought egg hunts were just for kids, but it looks like adults are participating too. $0#b#Not as fun then.$3",
    "Spring_17_Kimberly": "Miss Flor said that at the desert festival, you can buy old things from the villagers' stalls.$1",
    "Spring_17_Kimberly_2": "Jas told me that you can find interesting things even in the trash at the desert festival!$1",
    "Spring_22_Kimberly_2": "Today is my good friend Eloise's birthday. She's adorable!$1",
    "Summer_4_Kimberly_2": "Today is Jas's birthday. I heard she gets sad when people forget!$0",
    "Summer_9_Kimberly": "I heard it's not so hot in the mines, but the one-eyed old man won't let me near it.$3",
    "Summer_15_Kimberly": "Yes, that's what everyone's saying. Yesterday was Miss Flor's birthday!$0",
    "Fall_2_Kimberly_2": "Today is Miss Penny's birthday! YEAH!$1",
    "Fall_12_Kimberly": "I found a huge orange leaf. I'm going to frame it and put it on my bedroom wall.$1",
    "Fall_26_Kimberly": "Jas and Vincent said there are monsters at the Spirits' Eve party. I really wanted to see it, but I'll have to stay home.$2",
    "Fall_26_Kimberly_2": "My aunt comes to visit us on Spirits' Eve, she came from Castle Village, and she always tells us lots of scary stories!$1",
    "Winter_15_Kimberly": "I wonder if any boats will be selling artifacts today?$0",
    "Winter_15_Kimberly_2": "Trinnie, Eloise and Jas speak so highly of the night market. Too bad it only works at night.$2",
    "Winter_26_Kimberly": "I got an ornamental fan from my aunt. She found it somewhere in Grampleton. $1",
    "Winter_26_Kimberly_2": "My aunt gave me a dwarf helmet, she said she found it while adventuring in Castle Village!$1",
//Gifts
    "gifts.Kimberly.love": "This is as valuable as a rare artifact. I love it! $1",
    "gifts.Kimberly.love_(O)101":"Wow! This is the remains of a centuries-old weapon. I love it! $1",
    "gifts.Kimberly.love_(O)104":"Wow, @! That's so cool! This piece of jewelry is so amazing! $1",
    "gifts.Kimberly.like": "That's interesting! I really like it.$1",
    "gifts.Kimberly.like_(O)106":"WOW! It looks like it's from the 19th century. I really like it! $1",
    "gifts.Kimberly.like_(O)113":"Did you find this on your farm? That's awesome, I like it! $1",
    "gifts.Kimberly.dislike": "Uh... I don't like it.$2",
    "gifts.Kimberly.dislike_(O)881":"As much as I love old stuff and stuff, I don't like bone pieces. I don't want that, thanks.$3",
    "gifts.Kimberly.hate": "Ugh! I hate it. I don't want it!$3",
    "gifts.Kimberly.hate_(0)769":"What the hell is this? I hate it! $3",
    "gifts.Kimberly.neutral": "Yeah... It sounds interesting, I guess.$0",
    "gifts.Kimerly.neutral_(0)421":"It's not an artifact, but it's cute. $0",
    "gifts.Kimberly.BDPos": "This is my birthday present? HOW AWESOME! I LOVE IT!$1",
    "gifts.Kimberly.BDNeg": "This is my birthday present? This is horrible! I HATED IT!$3",
    "gifts.Kimberly.stardroptea": "An ancient drink, I heard... And it's still as delicious as it was centuries ago.$1",
//Kitty
    "Introduction_Kitty": "Hello, I'm Kitty. Do you live on that big farm near the bus stop?",
    "Mon_Kitty": "I didn't have enough fun this weekend, but I already have school today...",
    "Mon2_Kitty": "I fixed Eloise's braids, my mom taught me how to do some hairstyles. Did I mention she works at a beauty salon?",
    "Mon4_Kitty":"My favorite actress is Felicity Montenegro.#$b#Yeah, I know she's retired now, but her movies are still amazing!",
    "Mon6_Kitty":"%Kitty seems to have her mind on something else when you greet her.#$b#Oh, hi, farmer... Yesterday I found out that Felicity Montenegro is living in Zuzu City!#$b#Now I really want to live there!",
    "Mon8_Kitty":"My dad is home and mom is taking a vacation from the beauty salon. We're going on a family trip to Zuzu City Resort. #$b#I can't wait to get on a plane. Have you ever been on a plane? Were you scared?",
    "Tue_Kitty": "When I grow up, I want to be a movie actress! And then I'll live in Zuzu City!",
    "Tue2_Kitty": "I'm going to showcase all my favorite actresses for the science project. #b#What does this have to do with science? I don't know, but I'll think of something.",
    "Tue4_Kitty":"The history paper would be much more interesting if it was about the history of Zuzu City.#$b#Or about the actresses from Old Zuzu. I heard they were phenomenal!",
    "Tue6_Kitty":"Every Saturday, when my dad is home, we go to the mall, over in Zuzu Town.",
    "Tue8_Kitty":"Daddy helped me with my homework. I love it when he's home!",
    "Wed_Kitty": "Kara said my name is a cat's name. Maybe I'm a wildcat. Meow!",
    "Wed2_Kitty": "Have you ever been to Zuzu City? What? Did you live there?",
    "Wed4_Kitty":"What was your life like in Zuzu City? Did you have a farm there too? Did you have a lot of friends? Rich, fancy friends?",
    "Wed6_Kitty":"I'm going to present the Art of Dramaturgy for the Arts Seminar. I know a lot about playing dramatic characters!",
    "Wed8_Kitty":"Hey, my mom's salon won an award last week. I think it's now considered the best in Zuzu City.",
    "Thu_Kitty": "Me, Jas, Trinnie, Kimberly and Cammi always joke that we're at a movie awards show. My stage name will be Kitty D'Kid!",
    "Thu2_Kitty": "When I grow up I'm going to be an actress and I'm going to make my mom's beauty salon the most famous one ever!",
    "Thu4_Kitty":"Farmer, do you like watching movies? I love them!",
    "Thu6_Kitty":"My dad works in Chestervale. So he spends fifteen days at home and fifteen days in Chestervale. My mom doesn't like it very much.",
    "Thu8_Kitty":"Well, Cammi and I took a vote to choose the cutest boy in school!#$b#Don't tell anyone, farmer, but my vote goes to Yuuma. He's so cute!",
    "Fri_Kitty": "My mom works at a beauty salon in Zuzu City. She does great hair! You need to go there.",
    "Fri2_Kitty": "I'm one of the best students in the class, you can ask Miss Penny and Miss Flor!",
    "Fri4_Kitty": "I can't talk now. I have to study for the test!",
    "Fri6_Kitty":"I think there should be a drama club at school. I would love it!",
    "Fri8_Kitty":"Cammi has also traveled by plane and said that she had a lot of ear pain. Now I'm afraid to travel.!",
    "Sat_Kitty": "...",
    "Sun_Kitty": "...",
    "spring_8_Kitty_2": "There's a festival going on tomorrow in Zuzu City. But my mom said I can't go.",
    "spring_16_Kitty_2": "Today is Trinnie's birthday! I brought her a flower.",
    "spring_23_Kitty": "I'm interested in the dance festival. I'd definitely be named Queen!",
    "spring_23_Kitty_2": "This Haley is only the Queen of the Flower Festival because I don't participate.",
    "summer_4_Kitty_2": "Today is Jas's birthday! I'll give her a flower.",
    "summer_15_Kitty_2": "Of course I remembered Miss Flor's birthday. Mom bought her a ring from Zuzu City.",
    "summer_26_Kitty": "I don't care about the moon jellyfish, I'm just sad that summer is ending.",
    "summer_26_Kitty_2": "Summer shouldn't go by so fast!",
    "fall_2_Kitty_2": "Today is Miss Penny's birthday. I'll ask Mommy to bring her something from Zuzu City.",
    "fall_19_Kitty": "Trinnie and Keahi told me that tomorrow the girls and boys are going to compete in a festival in Ridgeside.",
    "fall_19_Kitty_2": "I wish I could attend the festival that's happening tomorrow at Ridgeside.",
    "fall_26_Kitty": "Have you decorated your farm with pumpkin lanterns yet? There's a lot of fancy decorations in Zuzu City!",
    "fall_26_Kitty_2": "My costume for the Eve of the Spirits will be Marilu Monray, a very famous actress from the 50s!",
    "winter_15_Kitty": "I think there must be more things to buy in Zuzu City than is in the weird boats.",
    "winter_15_Kitty_2": "My dad said he wanted to see what the night market boats were selling. #b#But my mom said we'd better go to the Zuzu City Shopping Center to buy the presents!",
    "winter_24_Kitty": "Have you decorated your farm for Winterstar? Have you bought the presents? It's always nice to give gifts to others! #b#My dad taught me that.",
    "winter_24_Kitty_2": "My dad filled our house with decorations and my mom bought a huge pine tree in Zuzu City. I'm so excited!",
//Gifts
    "gifts.Kitty.love": "What a fancy and modern thing! It looks like something worthy of a future actress. I love it!",
    "gifts.Kitty.like": "What a nice gift, thank you.",
    "gifts.Kitty.like_(O)167":"I really like drinking Joja Cola. Thank you very much!",
    "gifts.Kitty.dislike": "This is not very fancy, I don't like it...",
    "gifts.Kitty.hate": "How ugly! This is not worthy of a future actress. I hate it!",
    "gifts.Kitty.neutral": "Thank you for the gift...",
    "gifts.Kitty.BDPos": "Oh, my Yoba! Is this my birthday present? I love it! It looks so fancy! #b#It's something you'd buy in Zuzu City. I'm sure!",
    "gifts.Kitty.BDNeg": "How awful! Is this my birthday present? How humiliating! #b#Why don't you go to Zuzu City and buy me something decent?",
    "gifts.Kitty.stardroptea": "I love the color of this tea! Just looking at it, I can tell it's a fancy drink.Thank you!",
//Meha
//Meha lives with his younger sister and uncles because his parents are fighting in the war. He hates vegetables, loves sweet fruits, and can't receive flowers as gifts because his little sister is allergic.
    "Introduction_Meha": "Hi, my name is Meha! I'm from a very far away village, I have to take the train to get here.$1",
    "Mon_Meha": "Every day I have to wake up very early so I won't be late.$0",
    "Mon2_Meha": "My aunt put salad in my lunchbox again. Thank goodness Donny will share his pizza with me.$1",
    "Mon4_Meha":"Do you miss your parents, farmer? I'm missing my parents a lot today...$1",
    "Mon6_Meha":"I'm not that bad at math, but sometimes I get lazy doing calculations.$0",
    "Mon8_Meha":"Hi, farmer... Oh, I don't know what I want to be when I grow up... I just wish my parents would come back.$2",
    "Tue_Meha": "My aunt put salad in my lunchbox. I HATE VEGETABLES!$3",
    "Tue2_Meha": "I'm going to ask my uncle to help me with the science project!$0",
    "Tue4_Meha":"My aunt is going to help me with my History paper. I can't get any more bad grades...$0",
    "Tue6_Meha":"School should be more fun. But sometimes it's just letters and numbers.$3",
    "Tue8_Meha":"Yesterday Kara and I saw a baby squirrel fall out of a tree. Eloise checked on him and saw that he wasn't hurt. $1#$b# Then we put him back in the tree and his mom found him... It was so exciting! I hope that one day I'll meet my parents again too.$2",
    "Wed_Meha": "My sister and I are living with my uncles. $0#b#My father is a mariner and my mother is a nurse, they were both drafted into the war.$2",
    "Wed2_Meha": "My sister is still learning to read. That's why my uncles buy her children's books.$0",
    "Wed4_Meha":"I've seen so many fun things since the trip. You should travel by train more often, farmer @.$1",
    "Wed6_Meha":"Shh, @! Don't tell anyone, but I'm going to perform a dance at the Arts Seminar. $1#$b#It's called the Mushroom Dance, and it's a dance created by the people of my village.$1",
    "Wed8_Meha":"... Sometimes I think my sister doesn't remember what our parents were like. $2#$b#But she's always happy when she talks to them on the phone.$0",
    "Thu_Meha": "I'm very sleepy today, yesterday my sister had a nightmare and cried all night...$0",
    "Thu2_Meha": "My uncle helped me with my homework. He looks a lot like my dad, my uncle is his little brother.$0",
    "Thu4_Meha":"Do you grow vegetables on your farm, @? Geez, I hate vegetables!$3",
    "Thu6_Meha":"I really like playing during recess, but I like eating the pizzas that Donny brings in his lunchbox even more!$1",
    "Thu8_Meha":"That's right, @, the girls are having an election for the most handsome boy in school. Vincent, Yuuma and Muthu are tied.$0",
    "Fri_Meha": "Oh no, today we have spelling. And I didn't do my homework! I'm going to ask Donny for help.$0",
    "Fri2_Meha": "Does anyone understand what Miss Flor says?$0",
    "Fri4_Meha": "I'm really worried. I didn't study for the test. $2#b#Well, Cammi said we'll have a test today!$0",
    "Fri6_Meha":"My aunt let me watch 'Bob Psy 90' yesterday, but I ended up falling asleep halfway through.$0",
    "Fri8_Meha":"My dad calls us every Friday night now. Sometimes mom calls us on Saturday mornings.$0",
    "Sat_Meha": "...",
    "Sun_Meha": "...",
    "spring_Mon6_Meha": "I like spring, but my sister has allergies, so she gets really sick this time of year.$2",
    "spring_10_Meha_2": "Today is Vincent's birthday. He's a good friend.$1",
    "spring_15_Meha": "Miss Penny said that a lot of people from Pelican Town are going to a festival in the desert. Are you going?$0",
    "spring_15_Meha_2": "Miss Penny and Miss Flor should organize a school trip for us to attend the desert festival!$1",
    "summer_4_Meha_2": "Today is Jas's birthday, she's a really nice girl.$1#b No! I'm not blushing!$2",
    "summer_10_Meha": "This heat is terrible. Especially since I have to walk to the train station.$3",
    "summer_15_Meha_2": "What did you say? Was Miss Flor's birthday yesterday? Oh no... I forgot!$2",
    "summer_19_Meha": "This weekend, my uncle and my aunt are taking me to the sea! My sister and I are going to build lots of sandcastles!$1",
    "fall_2_Meha_2": "What? Today is Miss Penny's birthday? Oh no... I forgot!$2",
    "fall_26_Meha": "I'm going to help my aunt decorate the house. My sister is going to dress up as a princess! $1#b# I'm going to dress up as a mariner, just like my dad.$1",
    "fall_26_Meha_2": "This year I'm going to dress up as a Vampire Mariner! Yeah, I made that up!$1",
    "winter_11_Meha": "Today is Keahi's birthday. I'm thinking of a good prank for him!$1",
    "winter_15_Meha": "When I heard about the strange boats on the beach, I remembered my dad. I know, one day he will come back.$2",
    "winter_15_Meha_2": "I wanted to see the boats on the beach. Amy said she went before school and got to see them all!$1",
    "winter_24_Meha": "Yesterday a package arrived from my parents. They are our presents! But my uncles will only let us open them tomorrow.$1",
    "winter_24_Meha_2": "I'm looking forward to finding out what gifts my parents sent me this year!$1",
//Gifts
    "gifts.Meha.love": "Wow, this is for me? You're the best adult ever!$1",
    "gifts.Meha.love_(0)296":"I LOVE BLACKBERRIES! Thanks!$1",
    "gifts.Meha.like": "That's a cool gift. Thanks!$1",
    "gifts.Meha.like_(O)258":"I really like blueberries. Thank you very much!$1",
    "gifts.Meha.dislike": "Oh, I don't want that...$3",
    "gifts.Meha.dislike_(O)22":"Sorry, but I can't bring flowers home, my sister is allergic!$2",
    "gifts.Meha.hate": "You hate me? Then why are you giving me this? I don't want it.$3",
    "gifts.Meha.hate_(0)190": "Yuck, I hate vegetables!$3",
    "gifts.Meha.hate_(0)272": "Yuck, that tastes bad. I don't want it!$3",
    "gifts.Meha.neutral": "That's cool...$0",
    "gifts.Meha.BDPos": "This is my birthday present? How amazing! Thank you, farmer!$1",
    "gifts.Meha.BDNeg": "This is my birthday present? You really hate me, don't you, farmer?$3",
    "gifts.Meha.stardroptea": "Hmmmmm... This is delicious. Thank you!$1",
//Muthu
    "Introduction_Muthu": "Hi, I am Muthu.",
    "Mon_Muthu": "One day the bus almost crashed when it was raining. But something pushed it back on the road...",
    "Mon2_Muthu": "Amma used to tell me to keep my toys properly so I can find them when I want to play with them.",
    "Mon4_Muthu":"Yeah, I guess that's it, I hate geometry.",
    "Mon6_Muthu":"I heard you spend your days cutting down trees and breaking rocks, is that true? Is that all you do?",
    "Mon8_Muthu":"Yesterday I watched a documentary about the lands of the Republic of Ferngill... There are so many places to see.",
    "Tue_Muthu": "I didn't eat breakfast today... I am so hungry.",
    "Tue2_Muthu": "Oh, gosh! I didn't think of anything for the science project!",
    "Tue4_Muthu":"Sometimes I like to do crosswords when I'm on the bus.",
    "Tue6_Muthu":"When I grow up, I want to travel the world by ship.",
    "Tue8_Muthu":"I have four brothers, two of them go to college in Zuzu City. It's a boring city.",
    "Wed_Muthu": "The test this friday is going to be easy. I been studying since last saturday.",
    "Wed2_Muthu":"My Pita is a very calm man. No, he wasn't drafted to fight in the war. He's old.",
    "Wed4_Muthu":"You had so many places to live and see, why did you choose to live here in a small village?",
    "Wed6_Muthu":"Hi, @! I'm going to play a song on my flute for the Art Seminar. I hope I get a good grade.",
    "Wed8_Muthu":"I don't really feel like talking right now, farmer. I got a bad grade in geometry again.",
    "Thu_Muthu": "Ahmad sometimes bring te extra curry puffs from yesterday to share with me and Beng.",
    "Thu2_Muthu": "I really enjoy playing with Ahmad and Beng. Sometimes Keahi plays with us too!",
    "Thu4_Muthu":"I'm allergic to seafood. I only have to taste a little bit and I start to swell up.",
    "Thu6_Muthu":"What's your biggest dream, farmer @?",
    "Thu8_Muthu":"Cammi and Kitty have just decided to choose the cutest boy in school. What a nonsense!",
    "Fri_Muthu": "Ms Flor sometimes say really strange things...",
    "Fri2_Muthu": "Ugh... Today we have spelling!",
    "Fri4_Muthu": "Yes, Cammi heard Miss Penny say that she will have a surprise test today!",
    "Fri6_Muthu":"I'm looking forward to flying a kite tomorrow.",
    "Fri8_Muthu":"I missed the last episode of 'Bob Psy 90' yesterday, now I'll have to watch it today, but everyone is talking about it.",
    "Sat_Muthu": "...",
    "Sun_Muthu": "...",
    "spring_15_Muthu": "I wish I could go to the desert festival. I think it would be so much fun!",
    "spring_15_Muthu_2": "What's the desert festival like? Kara said people get weird eggs!",
    "spring_22_Muthu_2": "It's Eloise's birthday today. I found daffodils on my way to school, and I'm going to give them to her.",
    "spring_23_Muthu": "What's the point of a festival where all people dance?",
    "spring_23_Muthu_2": "What does the so-called Flower Queen get?",
    "summer_10_Muthu": "In the heat of summer, they invented an event to eat soup. Seriously?",
    "summer_10_Muthu_2": "I find this soup festival so strange.",
    "summer_15_Muthu_2": "Miss Flor told me not to worry about her birthday present. But I will draw a nice picture.",
    "summer_26_Muthu": "From my village, we can see the glow of moon jellyfish from afar.",
    "summer_26_Muthu_2": "It's beautiful to watch the moon jellyfish.",
    "fall_2_Muthu_2": "Today is Miss Penny's birthday! I'm going to do something really nice for her.",
    "fall_Mon4_Muthu": "I think it's really nice how the weather changes in the fall, everything turns orange and there are pumpkins everywhere!",
    "fall_26_Muthu": "Vincent and Keahi have been telling us horror stories since early morning. I can't stand hearing about the monster that lives in the sewers anymore!",
    "fall_26_Muthu_2": "Eloise told me that you can't put out the jack-o'-lanterns on Spirits' Eve, because bad things happen.",
    "winter_11_Muthu": "I'll give Keahi vinegar as a birthday present.#b#Yes. I know he hates it! Hehehehe.",
    "winter_15_Muthu": "I wanted to see what's on the boats at the beach, but they only work at night!",
    "winter_15_Muthu_2": "Hey, @! Is it true that there's a mermaid at the night market? WOW!",
    "winter_23_Muthu": "When will winter end? I can't stand being cold anymore!",
    "winter_23_Muthu_2":"I can't wait for winter to end. Sneezy!",
//Gifts
    "gifts.Muthu.love": "Wow, that's amazing. I loved it!",
    "gifts.Muthu.like": "I like this, thanks.",
    "gifts.Muthu.dislike": "Are you seriously going to give me this? I don't want it!",
    "gifts.Muthu.hate": "You must think I'm insufferable to give me something like this. I hate it!",
    "gifts.Muthu.neutral": "Yeah... Thanks...",
    "gifts.Muthu.BDPos": "Oh my Yoba! That's awesome! You remembered my birthday! Thanks.",
    "gifts.Muthu.BDNeg": "I was sad about your birthday present. I don't like it...",
    "gifts.Muthu.stardroptea": "A sweet and warm drink is a perfect drink!",
//Peter
//About: Peter is a boy who loves comics and superheroes. He loves Dinosaur Egg and pizza, and likes Survival Burger. He hates Cookies and corn.
    "Introduction_Peter": "Hey! I'm Peter. It's nice to meet you...",
    "Mon_Peter": "Huh? Sorry, I didn't hear you, I was thinking about the latest issue of the comic I'm reading.",
    "Mon2_Peter": "I'm a lot like my favorite hero, we're orphans, we live with some old relative, my grandmother in my case, and we're the best students in the class.",
    "Mon4_Peter":"'...He has the knack of heroism, he throws a web like no other...' Oh, hi, @! I'm humming the song from my favorite cartoon.",
    "Mon6_Peter":"Farmer, I found out there's a festival where people dress up as manga and comic book characters, called Comic Con! #$b#I wanted to go, but it's at the Zuzu City Convention Center, and my grandmother doesn't have the money to take me.",
    "Mon8_Peter":"I brought some comic books for Amy. I'm glad I have a friend like her.",
    "Tue_Peter": "Do radioactive spiders exist? Vincent and Keahi said you've faced all kinds of monsters... What do you think?",
    "Tue2_Peter": "I'm thinking about presenting something about spiders for my science project.",
    "Tue4_Peter":"Hey @! About my history paper? It's almost done. A hero always strives to be the best!",
    "Tue6_Peter":"I brought some comics to share with my friends during recess.",
    "Tue8_Peter":"Now I'm determined to save up money to try to go to the next Comic Con.",
    "Wed_Peter": "I like reading comics. There's one where the hero got bitten by a spider...",
    "Wed2_Peter": "With great power comes great responsibility.",
    "Wed4_Peter":"I lent Amy a comic book. I think she liked it.",
    "Wed6_Peter":"We need to present something for the Art Seminar. I started drawing a comic book for the exhibition. I hope the teacher likes it.",
    "Wed8_Peter":"I got a good grade in the Art Seminar. Maybe I'll become a great comic book artist in the future.",
    "Thu_Peter": "I lent some comics to Beng, he said who likes it, because there's not much to read.",
    "Thu2_Peter": "I've decided I'm going to start researching the effects of radiation.",
    "Thu4_Peter": "Beng is really enjoying reading comics. At least I'll have someone to talk to about what I like.",
    "Thu6_Peter":"The teacher said I nailed all my homework, so I think I'll make the most of my weekend.",
    "Thu8_Peter":"Cammi and Kitty created this game to find out which boy is the cutest. #$b#About the boys, I don't know, but I think Amy is really cute. And also Kimberly...",
    "Fri_Peter": "I'm not worried about spelling...",
    "Fri2_Peter": "My grades are still impeccable. So I'm going to help my friends who got bad grades.",
    "Fri4_Peter": "Cammi is lying to everyone that she will have a test today.",
    "Fri6_Peter":"Do you watch 'Bob Psy 90', farmer @? Don't you think I look a little like Shigiu?",
    "Fri8_Peter":"My grades are perfect. Grandma was very happy, and she bought me a new comic book!",
    "Sat_Peter": "...",
    "Sun_Peter": "...",
    "spring_10_Peter_2": "It's Vincent's birthday today! I'm going to give him some duplicate stickers I have.",
    "spring_12_Peter": "If I were to participate in the egg hunt, I'd be the fastest of them all. I'd find all the eggs!",
    "spring_12_Peter_2": "In my village, there is no egg hunt, but it's still fun to celebrate with the neighborhood.",
    "spring_15_Peter": "Miss Penny should go on a school trip to the desert so we can participate in the festival.",
    "spring_15_Peter_2": "Hey, is it true that at the desert festival, there's a crazy race in which a rooster and a scorpion participate?",
    "summer_2_Peter": "Summer is here! And I'm going to take advantage of it to read my comics!",
    "summer_15_Peter_2": "I made a drawing for Miss Flor. Yesterday was her birthday.",
    "summer_26_Peter_2": "I read a lot of comics over the summer.",
    "fall_2_Peter": "I drew a picture for Miss Penny. Today is her birthday!",
    "fall_15_Peter": "There's another festival in Pelican Town tomorrow, so we won't have class.",
    "fall_26_Peter": "Back in my village, we're having a little party for the Eve of the Spirits. My grandma sewed me my hero costume.",
    "fall_26_Peter_2": "My grandma has upgraded my costume for this year. I'm going to rock it on Spirits' Eve!",
    "winter_9_Peter": "I made a snowman of my favorite hero.",
    "winter_11_Peter_2": "Today is Keahi's birthday. He's playful, but I know he misses his mom. I think I understand him.",
    "winter_15_Peter": "I wonder what those weird boats sell?",
    "winter_15_Peter_2": "I heard there's a mermaid on one of the boats and she sings really well.",
    "winter_24_Peter": "As a gift, I want an action figure of my favorite hero.",
    "winter_24_Peter_2": "This year I want action figure of my favorite hero's villains as a gift!",
//Gifts
    "gifts.Peter.love": "@, this is super awesome! Thanks!",
    "gifts.Peter.like": "I really like this. Thanks, @...",
    "gifts.Peter.dislike": "I don't really like this...",
    "gifts.Peter.hate": "Not even a comic book villain would like this. I hate it!",
    "gifts.Peter.neutral": "Interesting.",
    "gifts.Peter.BDPos": "An honorable gift for my birthday? I feel like a hero right now. Thanks, @!",
    "gifts.Peter.BDNeg": "A terrible gift for my birthday? Geez, @, you make me feel like a villain. I hate it...",
    "gifts.Peter.stardroptea": "This is the drink of heroes! Thank you very much!",
//Teela
//About Teela is a girl who dreams of being a monster hunter. She loves Monster Musk and is very fond of strange fish like pufferfish and Sandfish. She hates Joja Cola and Bean Hotpot.
    "Introduction_Teela": "Hey, I'm Teela and I'm going to be a monster hunter when I grow up.",
    "Mon_Teela": "Hey, can you help me with my math homework? I know everything about monsters, but I'm terrible with numbers!",
    "Mon2_Teela": "Yesterday I read a book about monsters, it was so fun!",
    "Mon4_Teela":"I confess that sometimes I prefer to play with boys. Girls are nice, but they don't like my games.",
    "Mon6_Teela":"Over the weekend, I made a hardwood sword. It turned out heavier than I imagined.",
    "Mon8_Teela":"I wanted to kill monsters in magical forests. How come I'm too small for that?",
    "Tue_Teela": "Have you ever met a witch? Not the weird guy who lives in the tower. I mean, a real witch!",
    "Tue2_Teela": "Jas and Vincent told me you killed monsters. Could you help me with my science project then.",
    "Tue4_Teela":"I've been reading some stuff about the history of the Ferngill Republic. #$b#I haven't seen anything about the existence of monsters, but I should find out where they came from.",
    "Tue6_Teela":"Eloise said that not all monsters are bad. Some become friends, like slimes. #$b#Eloise said that her neighbor raises slimes.",
    "Tue8_Teela":"I made some cardboard daggers. They turned out great, but the teacher said they weren't good to bring into class.",
    "Wed_Teela": "I always run early in the morning to keep in shape. When I'm older, I'm going to join the Adventurer's Guild...",
    "Wed2_Teela": "Kimberly said she met Mr. Marlon, she calls him Old One-Eyed Man! Hehehehe!",
    "Wed4_Teela":"They say that near the railroad tracks, there is a secret path to the house of an evil witch who haunts the Valley. Do you think this is true?",
    "Wed6_Teela":"I was ready to present my fighting techniques for the Art Seminar, but the teacher wouldn't let me. #$b#Now I'll have to invent a fight choreography!",
    "Wed8_Teela":"I wanted Mom to buy me an old cowboy rifle, but she said it's not a toy for girls.#$b#I'm tired of this. Guns should be for girls too... It's a toy, farmer.",
    "Thu_Teela": "Why You want to know about my family? That's none of your business...",
    "Thu2_Teela": "My brother said I should have normal girlish dreams. Like growing up, getting married and having kids, but I don't want to be a housewife.",
    "Thu4_Teela": "You just walk around asking people questions? Don't you ever work? That's suspicious!",
    "Thu6_Teela":"Jas said that one of the young women in the village also wanted to hunt monsters. I think I look like her.",
    "Thu8_Teela":"Cammi and Kitty are asking about the hottest boys in school... To me, they're all disgusting.",
    "Fri_Teela": "Oh! No! Today we have spelling! Why don't we have a class on how to kill monsters?",
    "Fri2_Teela": "Yesterday I dreamed that I was hunting monsters in the lower floors of the mines!",
    "Fri4_Teela": "Cammi said we'll have a spelling test today. I don't know if it's true or if she just wants to scare me.",
    "Fri6_Teela":"Yesterday's episode of 'Bob Psy 90' was awesome, farmer. #$b#Have you ever imagined having psychic powers?",
    "Fri8_Teela":"I'm a little sad, @, my brother said that since I like guns so much, I should join the army. #$b#Fighting for the country is more praiseworthy than killing monsters. But I don't want to kill people...",
    "Sat_Teela": "...",
    "Sun_Teela": "...",
    "spring_10_Teela_2": "Today is Vincent's birthday! I caught a snail yesterday and brought it to... Shhhhhh! Don't say anything to Miss Penny!",
    "spring_15_Teela": "There's a cave in the desert full of monsters. And during the festival, you get prizes when you kill monsters. I wanted to go there so bad, but Miss Penny wouldn't let me!",
    "spring_15_Teela_2": "I really wanted to go to the desert festival. I heard the monsters there are scary.",
    "spring_16_Teela_2": "Today is Trinnie's birthday. She's so funny. I wonder what I can get her as a present?",
    "summer_4_Teela_2": "Today is Jas's birthday! She's so cute!",
    "summer_10_Teela": "Miss Penny and Miss Flor should take us to the beach for a field trip. Totally scientific!",
    "summer_15_Teela": "I LOVE SUMMER!... What? Miss Flor's birthday...? Oh my yoba...",
    "fall_2_Teela": "Fall is... What? Miss Penny's birthday...? Oh my yoba...",
    "fall_9_Teela": "Don't you feel like autumn has a different energy? It's a great time to hunt monsters. #b#I haven't found any yet, but it's only a matter of time.",
    "fall_22_Teela_22": "Did you hear the boys talk about a monster living in the sewers?",
    "fall_26_Teela": "I'm going to dress up as an adventurer for the Spirits' Eve party at my house!",
    "fall_26_Teela_2": "I heard that when you blow out a jack-o'-lantern on Spirits' Eve, monsters appear. #b#I'll blow one out and see!",
    "winter_12_Teela": "I built snow monsters and destroyed them all yesterday with my wooden sword.",
    "winter_15_Teela": "Are you going to see the strange boats today?",
